<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>It is Wednesday <m>0{7}:{30}</m> local time in Nairobi (take Nairobi to be on <m>37^\circ\,\mathrm{E}</m>). Take Honolulu to be on <m>158^\circ\,\mathrm{W}</m>. What are the day and the local time in Honolulu?</p><p>Day: [ Monday | Tuesday | Wednesday | Thursday | Friday | Saturday | Sunday ]  </p><p>Time: <fillin characters="3" name="ans2"/> : <fillin characters="3" name="ans3"/>   </p></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>The difference in longitude is <m>{195}^\circ</m>, so the time difference is <m>{195} \times 4 = {780}</m> min <m>= {13}</m> h <m>{0}</m> min. Honolulu is west of Nairobi, so its time is behind. Counting back from Wednesday <m>0{7}:{30}</m> gives a time on the previous day: Tuesday <m>{18}:{30}</m>.</p></p></solution>
    <answer><p>Tuesday</p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>18</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>30</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>